  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Emergency Response to the populations affected by the devastating effects of east coast Daniel Storm in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project WHO, in close collaboration with health authorities, supports the revitalization of the healthcare delivery system in the affected areas, restoring ambulatory referral services, improving functionality of fixed health facilities and the deployment and coordination of mobile medical teams and mobile clinics to expand access to essential healthcare for the displaced population. This project targets 258,622 affected people with Health sector activities.</narrative>
  </description>
